# NAME: ByteDance Direct
# PURPOSE: Direct-route Douyin/ByteDance domestic domains misrouted by upstream proxy rule sets.
# ORDER: Place before TikTok and other ByteDance-related proxy rule sets.
# UPSTREAM PROXY RULE SETS:
# https://raw.githubusercontent.com/blackmatrix7/ios_rule_script/master/rule/Surge/TikTok/TikTok.list
# SOURCES:
# https://raw.githubusercontent.com/blackmatrix7/ios_rule_script/master/rule/Surge/ByteDance/ByteDance.list
# https://raw.githubusercontent.com/blackmatrix7/ios_rule_script/master/rule/Surge/DouYin/DouYin.list
# NOTE: Douyin PCDN/P2P delivery uses short-lived randomized domains (e.g. ydycdn.com,
# qrstuvwxyzab.com) that resolve to residential broadband IPs. New ones may appear over
# time; check Surge Dashboard for proxied video traffic and append them here.

# Confirmed misrouted, observed carrying Douyin video traffic
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,idouyinvod.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,ydycdn.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,qrstuvwxyzab.com

